          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AMBUJE ŵasalile kuti, “Msiŵice mwakusunjila yipanje.” Myoyo najigele mbiya sya silifa sila, pa mtengo awula uŵatite ngwenela kupocela ula ni kuja kukusiponya mwakusunjila yipanje m'Nyumba ja AMBUJE. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaneko natemenye simbo jine jila jakolanjidwa “Umpepe”, kulosya kumasya ulongo sikati ja Yuda ni Isalaeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sambano AMBUJE ŵasalile kuti, “Mjigale soni yida ya mkucinga, mkucinga jwakwe jwangali mate. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pakuti tinjimŵika kuŵa mkucinga mcilambo, mkucinga jwele ngisasamala ngondolo syakwasika, ngisaja kukusosasosa syakusokonecela, kapena kuposya syakulwala, ni kulisya sya umi. Nambo jwalakwejo tacigambaga kulya nyama ja ngondolo syakunakana, mpaka kupululaga ni yiboda yakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Likungu kwa mkucinga jwangu, jwangali matejo. Jwalakwejo akusaleka ngondolo syakwe. Jwalakwejo ajonanjidwe pa ngondo. Mkono wakwe tiwucinyala, nipo liso lyakwe lya kumlyo tilicitatala.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
